{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++0x code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++0x code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <algorithm>\nusing namespace std;\n\ntypedef long long ll;\n\nll gcd(ll a, ll b) {\n    while (b) {\n        a %= b;\n        swap(a, b);\n    }\n    return a;\n}\n\ninline ll myabs(ll a) { return a < 0 ? -a : a; }\n\nbool isBetter(ll num, ll den, ll bestNum, ll bestDen, ll x, ll y) {\n    return bestDen * myabs(x * den - num * y) < den * myabs(x * bestDen - bestNum * y);\n}\n\nint main() {\n    ios_base::sync_with_stdio(false);\n    cin.tie(nullptr);\n    ll x, y, n;\n    cin >> x >> y >> n;\n    ll g = gcd(x, y);\n    x /= g;\n    y /= g;\n    if (y <= n) {\n        cout << x << '/' << y << endl;\n        return 0;\n    }\n    ll bestNum = 1000000000;\n    ll bestDen = 1;\n    ll i = 1;\n    do {\n        ll cur = (x * i) / y;\n        if (isBetter(cur, i, bestNum, bestDen, x, y)) {\n            bestDen = i;\n            bestNum = cur;\n        }\n        cur++;\n        if (isBetter(cur, i, bestNum, bestDen, x, y)) {\n            bestDen = i;\n            bestNum = cur;\n        }\n        i++;\n    } while (i <= n);\n    cout << bestNum << '/' << bestDen << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.Scanner;\n\npublic class Main {\n    private static long gcd(long a, long b) {\n        while (b != 0) {\n            a %= b;\n            long temp = a;\n            a = b;\n            b = temp;\n        }\n        return a;\n    }\n\n    private static long myabs(long a) {\n        return a < 0 ? -a : a;\n    }\n\n    private static boolean isBetter(long num, long den, long bestNum, long bestDen, long x, long y) {\n        return bestDen * myabs(x * den - num * y) < den * myabs(x * bestDen - bestNum * y);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);\n        long x = scanner.nextLong();\n        long y = scanner.nextLong();\n        long n = scanner.nextLong();\n\n        long g = gcd(x, y);\n        x /= g;\n        y /= g;\n\n        if (y <= n) {\n            System.out.println(x + \"/\" + y);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        long bestNum = 1000000000L;\n        long bestDen = 1L;\n        long i = 1L;\n\n        do {\n            long cur = (x * i) / y;\n            if (isBetter(cur, i, bestNum, bestDen, x, y)) {\n                bestDen = i;\n                bestNum = cur;\n            }\n            cur++;\n            if (isBetter(cur, i, bestNum, bestDen, x, y)) {\n                bestDen = i;\n                bestNum = cur;\n            }\n            i++;\n        } while (i <= n);\n\n        System.out.println(bestNum + \"/\" + bestDen);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n1.0\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.4305105e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -3.9695904e-05, -0.00016985882, -2.0265559e-06, -0.029886603, -0.028386597, -0.0041011996, -0.00012671144, -2.3841855e-07, -0.009011314, -0.00248897, -0.018179344, -0.7254648, -2.1576649e-05, -0.00013243275, -0.0015247159, -9.5367386e-07